'''Aspect of the Brine King''' is a Pantheon [[aspect]] skill that grants a [[buff]] which inflicts [[chill]] on enemies within its radius, increases your chill effect, and grants [[cold]] [[penetration]] against chilled enemies. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
This buff causes the player to [[chill]] enemies within a [[distance]] listed on the skill, with a base chill of 10% [[action speed]] slow before chill effect modifiers. 

As a chill from the player, its effect scales with ailment effect modifiers, it can apply ''chilled by you'' stats, counts as having ''chilled recently'', cannot chill with ''Cannot Chill'', and can be reflected by {{il|The Fulcrum}}. It is not a [[chilling area]].

See also {{psl|Chilling Presence}} and {{il|Expedition's End}}.

Aspect of the Brine King cannot be supported by {{il|Enlighten Support}}, as it is not a skill from a skill gem.

==Acquisition==
Aspect of the Brine King is obtained exclusively by using {{il|Brinehook's Ducat}} during [[Allflame crafting]], which adds {{ml|GrantsBrineKingAspectCrafted}} to the item.

